cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the archived release used for reproducibility; see ZENODO.md for DOI setup."
title: "A real affine (23_4) configuration"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Strinz
    given-names: Will
abstract: >-
  An explicit configuration of 23 distinct real affine points and 23 distinct
  lines, with exactly four selected incidences at every point and line.
  Includes rational coordinates, a compact construction, an exact figure,
  a Lean existence proof, and independently checked proof verification records.
  Publication priority is not asserted.
keywords:
  - incidence geometry
  - geometric configurations
  - "23_4"
  - Lean
  - formal proof
  - rational construction
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/wstrinz/configuration-23-4"
# Version, release date and DOI are omitted until actually known.
# Never copy the example repository's DOI into this project.
